LZ4 1.10.0, vendored from https://github.com/lz4/lz4 (tag v1.10.0): lib/lz4.c, lib/lz4.h,
lib/LICENSE (BSD-2-Clause). Unmodified.
Built only through src/core/lz.c (the savestate codec), freestanding: LZ4_memcpy is
__builtin_memcpy, LZ4_memset is sysclib memset, LZ4_memmove is a local byte loop, every LZ4 entry
point is made static (LZ4LIB_VISIBILITY) so unused code is dropped, LZ4_MEMORY_USAGE 13.
